// A first song. The part names its words, `lyrics` holds them, the score's row prints them,
// and the `singer` line is what makes them heard. Open the preview and press Play.
octave relative
time 4/4
key c major
tempo 96
part melody { instrument alto  lyrics words }
section A {
  melody {
    c'4 d e f | g2 g | a4 a g2 | f4 f e2 | d2 c |
  }
  lyrics words {
    あ か る い | そ ら | う た を | う た お | う よ |
  }
}
form { A }
singer female on melody
score { staff melody  lyrics words }
